WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:09.075
OH

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:10.976
I,

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:11.544
I,

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:13.146
I THINK WE JUST MADE SOME
HISTORY.

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:22.388
SO,

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:23.523
SOUTH CAROLINA.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:24.891
YOU

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.862
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION WHAT
IS POSSIBLE.

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:35.001
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION THAT
IN THIS

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.870
ERA OF PARTISAN DIVIDES,

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:40.172
OF VITRIOL AND NAME-CALLING.

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:45.778
IN A POLITICS DOMINATED BY
BILLIONAIRES AND SPECIAL
INTEREST GROUPS AND

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:49.783
INSIDERS IN WASHINGTON DC THAT
WE WILL NOT BOW DOWN.

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:58.525
THAT WE WILL NOT BACK DOWN AND
WE WILL CHART OUR OWN COURSE.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:07.333
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION THAT
WE CAN COME TOGETHER TO DEFEND
SOUTH CAROLINA.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:15.775
AND TODAY YOU HAVE ELECTED A
SENATOR THAT WILL ALWAYS PUT
SOUTH CAROLINA FIRST.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:22.681
NOT ONLY THAT,

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.250
BUT YOU HAVE ELECTED

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.286
THE FIRST PEDIATRICIAN.

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:28.488
UNITED STATES SENATE

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:35.728
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:45.071
THE FIRST WOMAN THAT SOUTH
CAROLINA HAS EVER SENT TO THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.014
SO FROM THE BOTTOM OF MY HEART,

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:56.816
THANK YOU.

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.086
I WANNA START BY THANKING

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.487
DARLENE GRAHAM

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.522
FOR HER PUBLIC SERVICE

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.992
AND HER LOVE FOR SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:08.461
AND I WISH HER AND HER FAMILY
WELL.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:09.762
AND I,

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.431
AND I JUST,

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:15.535
AND I JUST SPOKE WITH HER AND
SHE CONGRATULATED ME ON OUR
VICTORY TONIGHT.

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:24.110
AND TO THE HEARTBEAT,

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:26.278
THE HEARTBEAT OF OUR CAMPAIGN,

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:27.714
OUR VOLUNTEERS.

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:34.086
WHO WORKED THEIR TAILS OFF AND
NEVER STOPPED BELIEVING,

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:34.686
THANK YOU,

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:35.254
THANK YOU,

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:36.089
THANK YOU.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.992
AND TO OUR STATE PARTY
CHAIRWOMAN,

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:41.161
CRYSTAL SPAIN.

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:45.364
THE FIRST

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:48.034
BLACK WOMAN TO LEAD OUR STATE'S
PARTY.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.974
WHO INVESTED IN THIS RACE,

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:56.041
WHO BELIEVED IN US,

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:57.143
WHO BELIEVED IN ME,

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.778
AND WORKED TIRELESSLY,

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:04.183
TIRELESSLY TO BUILD A STRONGER
SOUTH CAROLINA ACROSS ALL 46
COUNTIES.

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:04.750
THANK YOU,

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:05.351
CRYSTAL.

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:11.090
AND TO MY DEAR FRIEND JAMIE
HARRISON,

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:12.926
WE WOULD NOT BE HERE WITHOUT
YOU.

00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:14.294
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:22.468
TO ALL OF OUR INCREDIBLE STAFF
WHO POURED THEIR HEARTS AND
SOULS INTO THIS RACE,

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:23.236
THANK YOU.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:29.275
TO THE THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE WHO
WELCOMED US INTO THEIR HOMES,

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:29.976
THEIR CHURCHES,

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:30.743
THEIR BUSINESSES,

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:32.511
AND ONTO THEIR FRONT PORCHES,

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.013
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.050
AND TO THE REPUBLICANS,

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.252
INDEPENDENTS,

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.921
AND DEMOCRATS WHO TOOK A CHANCE
ON A PEDIATRICIAN

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:43.590
AND A MOM OF THREE.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:51.296
BECAUSE YOU BELIEVE THAT SOUTH
CAROLINA SHOULD COME FIRST,

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:52.098
THANK YOU.

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:55.601
SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:57.136
MY NAME MAY HAVE BEEN ON THE
BALLOT,

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.937
BUT THIS VICTORY DOESN'T BELONG
TO ME.

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:00.773
IT BELONGS TO ALL OF YOU.

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:04.810
BECAUSE TONIGHT,

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:07.713
WE HERE IN SOUTH CAROLINA SENT A
CLEAR MESSAGE

00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:11.083
THAT THIS SENATE SEAT DOES NOT
BELONG TO ONE FAMILY,

00:04:11.351 --> 00:04:12.284
ONE PARTY,

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:14.354
OR TO WASHINGTON DC.

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:24.263
IT BELONGS TO YOU AND IT ALWAYS
WILL.

00:04:24.864 --> 00:04:27.666
WE EMBARKED ON THIS JOURNEY OVER
18 MONTHS AGO,

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:30.202
AND WHILE IT WAS LONG AND
EXHAUSTING,

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:34.640
AND THERE WERE PLENTY OF DAYS
WHEN I WAS RUNNING ON NOTHING
BUT PROTEIN BARS,

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:35.274
COFFEE,

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:37.576
AND GIANT DIET COKES FROM GAS
STATIONS.

00:04:37.977 --> 00:04:40.546
IT TRULY HAS BEEN THE JOURNEY OF
A LIFETIME.

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:44.150
WE TOOK THIS CAMPAIGN TO EVERY
SINGLE ONE OF OUR 46 COUNTIES,

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.718
FROM SMALL TOWNS AND MAIN
STREETS TO FARMS

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:47.986
AND OUR RURAL COMMUNITIES,

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:50.956
FROM THE BLUE RIDGE MOUNTAINS IN
THE UPSTATE TO THE SWAMPS,

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:53.092
THE LITERAL SWAMPS IN THE
MIDLANDS,

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:55.662
TO THE BEACHES HERE IN THE LOW
COUNTRY.

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:03.702
I SAT ON THE BACK OF A PICKUP
TRUCK WITH AN 8TH GENERATION

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:07.273
FARMER IN BARNWELL WHO TOLD ME
THAT IT NOW COST HER $1900.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:37.970
Y'ALL,

00:05:38.404 --> 00:05:39.772
I THOUGHT MY FARMER FRIEND WAS
HERE.

00:05:41.808 --> 00:05:45.445
SHE TOLD ME IT COST $1900 TO
FILL UP HER TRACTOR WITH DIESEL

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:48.647
AND THAT TANK OF GAS WILL ONLY
LAST HER FOR 3 DAYS.

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:51.784
AND THAT FARM THAT'S BEEN IN HER
SOUTH CAROLINA FAMILY FOR EIGHT

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:55.588
GENERATIONS MIGHT NOT LAST
ANOTHER YEAR OR TWO IF THINGS
DON'T CHANGE.

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:58.191
I STOOD SHOULDER TO SHOULDER
WITH VETERANS IN RIDGELAND,

00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:00.993
TEARS IN THEIR EYES AS THEY TOLD
ME THAT THEY'VE LOST

00:06:01.227 --> 00:06:02.594
FRIENDS TO SUICIDE,

00:06:02.795 --> 00:06:03.729
THAT THEIR FIGHT

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.464
FOR THEIR BENEFITS THAT THEY'VE
EARNED,

00:06:05.565 --> 00:06:09.836
AND THEIR FEAR OF ANOTHER
GENERATION BEING SENT OFF TO A
RECKLESS WAR.

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:15.707
I'VE SPOKEN TO SENIORS WHO'VE
WORKED THEIR ENTIRE LIVES,

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:16.475
RAISED THEIR FAMILY,

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:18.010
AND DID EVERYTHING

00:06:18.111 --> 00:06:18.878
RIGHT,

00:06:19.746 --> 00:06:22.614
ONLY TO FIND THEMSELVES
STRUGGLING TO GET BY ON THEIR
SOCIAL SECURITY CHECKS.

00:06:22.882 --> 00:06:26.418
I'VE SEEN NEIGHBORS LOOKING OUT
FOR EACH OTHER REGARDLESS OF
POLITICAL PARTY,

00:06:26.519 --> 00:06:29.789
FAMILIES COMING TOGETHER TO HELP
EACH OTHER THROUGH HARD TIMES,

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:32.825
AND CHURCH CONGREGATIONS OPENING
THEIR HEARTS AND DOORS

00:06:32.925 --> 00:06:35.428
TO ANYONE WHO NEEDS A HELPING
HAND.

00:06:36.129 --> 00:06:37.963
THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA THAT
I KNOW.

00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:41.601
THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA THAT
I AM PROUD TO CALL HOME.

00:06:47.173 --> 00:06:49.308
AND THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA
THAT I WILL FIGHT

00:06:49.409 --> 00:06:52.812
FOR EVERY SINGLE DAY IN THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:06:58.084 --> 00:07:01.386
AND TO THE SOUTH CAROLINIANS WHO
DID NOT VOTE FOR ME,

00:07:01.487 --> 00:07:04.256
I KNOW WE MAY NOT AGREE ON
EVERYTHING,

00:07:04.357 --> 00:07:06.759
AND I MAY NOT HAVE EARNED YOUR
VOTE TODAY,

00:07:06.859 --> 00:07:08.427
BUT I WANT YOU TO KNOW THIS,

00:07:08.628 --> 00:07:10.530
I WILL BE YOUR SENATOR TOO.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.301
I WILL LISTEN TO YOU,

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:16.902
I WILL SHOW UP FOR YOU,

00:07:17.003 --> 00:07:21.940
AND I WILL FIGHT JUST AS HARD
FOR YOU AND YOUR CHILDREN AS I
WOULD MY OWN.

00:07:22.341 --> 00:07:24.143
THAT'S THE KIND OF SENATOR THAT
I'LL BE.

00:07:28.047 --> 00:07:30.249
I'LL BE AN INDEPENDENT VOICE WHO
WILL WORK WITH ANYONE,

00:07:30.483 --> 00:07:31.516
REPUBLICAN OR DEMOCRAT,

00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:33.853
TO DO WHAT'S RIGHT FOR SOUTH
CAROLINA.

00:07:34.153 --> 00:07:37.823
I WILL BE A BRICK WALL BETWEEN
WASHINGTON DC AND SOUTH
CAROLINA,

00:07:37.924 --> 00:07:40.359
EVEN WHEN IT MEANS STANDING UP
TO MY OWN PARTY.

00:07:43.396 --> 00:07:46.966
NOBODY IN WASHINGTON RECRUITED
ME TO RUN.

00:07:49.836 --> 00:07:54.106
NOBODY HANDED ME A SEAT IN THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:07:56.542 --> 00:07:59.011
AND NOBODY WROTE ME A SCRIPT.

00:07:59.545 --> 00:08:00.045
I,

00:08:00.279 --> 00:08:00.746
I,

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:03.416
I OWE NO ONE IN WASHINGTON

00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:04.550
ANYTHING.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.519
I OWE SOUTH CAROLINA

00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:07.553
EVERYTHING.

00:08:12.558 --> 00:08:14.993
AND THAT'S EXACTLY WHO I'M GONNA
ANSWER TO.

00:08:15.094 --> 00:08:18.130
NOW I NEVER IMAGINED THAT I
WOULD END UP IN POLITICS.

00:08:18.364 --> 00:08:19.364
SINCE I WAS 4,

00:08:19.465 --> 00:08:21.867
I'VE ONLY EVER DREAMED OF
BECOMING A DOCTOR,

00:08:21.968 --> 00:08:23.869
AND FOR THE PAST 20 YEARS,

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:27.072
I'VE DEDICATED MY LIFE TO CARING
FOR SICK AND INJURED CHILDREN.

00:08:27.473 --> 00:08:32.144
BUT WHAT I SAW AS A PEDIATRICIAN
AND WHAT I'VE EXPERIENCED
RAISING MY OWN 3 CHILDREN

00:08:32.345 --> 00:08:35.381
MADE ME REALIZE THAT I COULDN'T
JUST SIT ON THE SIDELINES
ANYMORE.

00:08:35.481 --> 00:08:38.684
I WATCHED AS INSURANCE COMPANIES
STOOD BETWEEN SICK CHILDREN

00:08:38.784 --> 00:08:40.185
AND THE CARE THAT THEY NEED.

00:08:40.653 --> 00:08:43.556
I'VE SEEN HOW DECISIONS MADE IN
WASHINGTON AFFECT THE

00:08:43.656 --> 00:08:46.158
LIVES OF THE CHILDREN AND
FAMILIES I'VE CARED FOR,

00:08:46.459 --> 00:08:48.127
AND THAT'S WHY I DECIDED TO RUN,

00:08:48.561 --> 00:08:52.665
BECAUSE I BELIEVE WE HAVE A
RESPONSIBILITY TO LEAVE OUR
CHILDREN SOMETHING BETTER

00:08:52.765 --> 00:08:54.200
THAN WHAT WE INHERITED.

00:08:57.403 --> 00:09:00.739
A SOUTH CAROLINA WHERE A FAMILY
CAN AFFORD TO FILL UP A GAS
TANK,

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.374
PUT GROCERIES ON THE TABLE,

00:09:02.475 --> 00:09:04.543
AND GET THE CHILDCARE THEY NEED
WITHOUT

00:09:04.877 --> 00:09:06.479
WORRYING ABOUT GOING BROKE.

00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:09.448
WHEN DECISIONS WHERE DECISIONS
ABOUT OUR COMMUNITIES

00:09:09.549 --> 00:09:11.183
ARE MADE BY THE PEOPLE WHO LIVE

00:09:11.284 --> 00:09:12.585
IN OUR COMMUNITIES,

00:09:12.685 --> 00:09:15.621
NOT THE BILLIONAIRES OR DATA
CENTER COMPANIES IN WASHINGTON
DC.

00:09:18.624 --> 00:09:23.195
AND WHERE THE NEXT GENERATION
CAN AFFORD TO BUILD A LIFE AND
RAISE A FAMILY HERE.

00:09:23.296 --> 00:09:25.264
THAT'S THE FUTURE THAT I'M
FIGHTING FOR.

00:09:28.534 --> 00:09:30.770
AND I KNOW THAT THE WORK AHEAD
WON'T BE EASY,

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:34.907
BUT AFTER 18 MONTHS IN 46
COUNTIES AND EVERYTHING WE'VE
BEEN THROUGH

00:09:35.207 --> 00:09:35.874
TOGETHER,

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:38.311
I'VE NEVER BEEN MORE CERTAIN OF
ONE THING.

00:09:39.445 --> 00:09:42.515
SOUTH CAROLINA'S BEST DAYS ARE
STILL AHEAD OF US.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.973
AND I PROMISE YOU I'M GONNA GIVE
YOU EVERYTHING I HAVE TO MAKE
SURE WE GET THERE.

00:10:08.074 --> 00:10:10.042
TO BUILD A SOUTH CAROLINA YOU
CAN AFFORD,

00:10:10.142 --> 00:10:13.078
A SOUTH CAROLINA YOU CAN ALWAYS
BE PROUD TO CALL HOME,

00:10:13.179 --> 00:10:15.947
AND A SOUTH CAROLINA THAT WILL
ALWAYS COME FIRST.

00:10:16.282 --> 00:10:18.049
SO THANK YOU FOR BELIEVING IN
ME.

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:20.786
THANK YOU FOR MAKING HISTORY
WITH ME

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:21.821
TONIGHT.

00:10:22.188 --> 00:10:22.654
AND,

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:24.456
AND MOST IMPORTANTLY,

00:10:24.557 --> 00:10:27.826
WE HAD TO MOVE THIS PART TO THE
END SO I WOULDN'T BE A
BLUBBERING IDIOT UP HERE.

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:29.060
MOST IMPORTANTLY,

00:10:29.161 --> 00:10:29.828
THANK YOU

00:10:29.929 --> 00:10:30.796
TO MY FAMILY.

00:10:36.402 --> 00:10:40.172
TO MY PARENTS WHO HAVE STOOD BY
ME EVERY STEP OF THE WAY.

00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:43.175
AND TO MY,

00:10:43.275 --> 00:10:44.543
TO MY 3 CHILDREN.

00:10:51.917 --> 00:10:53.752
THANK YOU FOR EVERY HUG,

00:10:53.986 --> 00:10:56.122
EVERY WORD OF ENCOURAGEMENT.

00:10:57.223 --> 00:10:58.324
I LOVE YOU MORE.

00:10:58.424 --> 00:11:00.159
I LOVE YOU MORE THAN WORDS,

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:01.293
HENRY,

00:11:01.394 --> 00:11:03.229
THAN WORDS WILL EVER EXPRESS.

00:11:03.529 --> 00:11:04.797
I'M SO PROUD OF YOU GUYS.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:15.641
AND BEING YOUR MOM WILL ALWAYS
BE THE MOST IMPORTANT JOB I
HAVE.

00:11:19.845 --> 00:11:20.212
RIGHT.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:21.580
ALL RIGHT.

00:11:22.782 --> 00:11:25.484
AND I HOPE THAT WHEN YOU LOOK
BACK ON THIS MOMENT,

00:11:25.685 --> 00:11:26.419
ALL THREE OF YOU,

00:11:26.519 --> 00:11:28.186
I HOPE THAT YOU REMEMBER
SOMETHING

00:11:28.521 --> 00:11:31.123
THAT YOU CAN STAND UP FOR WHAT
YOU BELIEVE IN.

00:11:32.224 --> 00:11:34.994
THAT YOU CAN SPEAK OUT WHEN
SOMETHING ISN'T RIGHT.

00:11:36.295 --> 00:11:38.063
AND NO MATTER HOW BIG THE
CHALLENGE,

00:11:38.164 --> 00:11:41.167
YOU SHOULD NEVER BE AFRAID TO
TRY TO MAKE THINGS BETTER.

00:11:46.672 --> 00:11:50.443
BECAUSE YOU NEVER KNOW WHAT'S
POSSIBLE IF YOU'RE WILLING TO
TRY.

00:11:55.681 --> 00:11:57.016
SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:11:57.516 --> 00:11:58.917
I LOVE YOU.

00:11:59.251 --> 00:12:00.318
THANK YOU

00:12:00.619 --> 00:12:01.721
AND GOOD NIGHT.

